  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building resilience in the Kaya-Dori axis in Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Program is to &quot;Contribute to the restoration of security and peace, to strengthen the resilience of the area and to structurally transform the local economy, for strong, green, sustainable and inclusive growth&quot;.More specifically, these are:- Effectively manage the humanitarian emergency through access to food, WASH and cash-to-work - Relaunch green, inclusive and sustainable economic growth in the area;- Strengthen the local governance for peace building and reconciliation.</narrative>
  </description>
